---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Finance Calculator Privacy Policy - Logicpath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Finance Calculator</strong></p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">Logicpath Systems &middot; <strong>Effective date:</strong> 16 November 2026</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>This Privacy Policy explains what information the Finance Calculator app (&ldquo;the App&rdquo;) collects, how it is used and shared, and the choices you have. It applies only to the App. By using the App, you agree to this Privacy Policy.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>1. Information you enter in the App</h2>
                    <p>All calculations (SIP, Lumpsum, SWP, EMI, Loan Prepayment, Loan Eligibility, Compare Loans, Loan Foreclosure, GST and Income Tax) are performed on your device. We do not collect, upload, store on our servers, share or sell the amounts, incomes, rates or any other numbers you enter.</p>
                    <p>The App does not require an account, and we do not ask for your name, email address, phone number, PAN, Aadhaar, bank details or any other personal identity information.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>2. Information collected by third-party services</h2>
                    <p>The App uses the following Google services. They may collect some information automatically from your device, as described below and in their own privacy policies.</p>

                    <div class="table-wrapper">
                        <table>
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Service</th>
                                    <th>Information that may be collected</th>
                                    <th>Purpose</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Google AdMob (ads)</strong></td>
                                    <td>Advertising ID, IP address, approximate location derived from IP address, device and app information (such as device model, operating system and app version), ad interactions and crash or performance data related to ads</td>
                                    <td>Showing ads, limiting how often ads are shown, measuring ads and preventing fraud</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Google Analytics for Firebase</strong></td>
                                    <td>App usage events (for example, which calculator is opened or when a PDF report is created), app instance ID, device and app information, and approximate location derived from IP address</td>
                                    <td>Understanding how the App is used so that we can improve it. It does not receive the numbers you enter.</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Google Fonts</strong></td>
                                    <td>IP address, when fonts are downloaded the first time they are needed</td>
                                    <td>Displaying text in the App</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <h3>Third-party privacy policies:</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Google Privacy Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
                        <li>How Google uses information from apps that use its services: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a></li>
                        <li>Google AdMob: <a href="https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543</a></li>
                        <li>Firebase privacy and security: <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy</a></li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
                    <p>Information collected through the services above is used only to show ads that keep the App free, to measure and prevent fraud, and to understand and improve the App. We do not use it to identify you personally, and we do not sell personal information.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>4. Sharing of information</h2>
                    <p>We do not share or sell your personal information. Information is collected and processed by Google as our service provider for the purposes described above. We may disclose information if required by law or by a valid order of a court or government authority.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>5. Advertising choices and consent</h2>
                    <p>You can reset your advertising ID or opt out of personalised ads at any time in your Android device settings (Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads, or Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Ads, depending on your device).</p>
                    <p>In the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland, we ask for your consent before ads use your data for personalisation. Where this applies, you can change your choice at any time in the App under Settings &gt; Privacy options.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>6. PDF reports and files</h2>
                    <p>Some calculators let you create a PDF report. The report is created on your device only when you choose to create it, and it is shared or saved only where you choose. We do not receive a copy.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>7. Permissions</h2>
                    <p>The App uses an internet connection for ads, analytics and fonts. The App does not request access to your contacts, precise location, camera, microphone, SMS or call logs. The advertising ID permission is used by Google AdMob as described above.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>8. Data retention and deletion</h2>
                    <p>We do not store your calculations, so there is nothing for us to delete. Uninstalling the App removes all data the App has stored on your device. Information collected by Google services is kept according to Google's retention policies; Google Analytics data is kept for a limited period set in our Firebase settings and then deleted automatically. To request deletion of analytics data linked to your app instance, contact us at the email address below and we will help you.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>9. Security</h2>
                    <p>Information sent to Google services is encrypted in transit using HTTPS. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect information.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>10. Children's privacy</h2>
                    <p>The App is intended for a general adult audience and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information through the App, please contact us and we will take steps to remove it.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>11. Your rights</h2>
                    <p>Depending on where you live, including under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you may have rights to access, correct or delete your personal data, and to withdraw consent. Because the App does not collect identity information, most requests can be met through the device and ad settings described above. For any request or grievance, contact us at the email address below and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>12. Disclaimer</h2>
                    <p>The App provides estimates for general information and educational purposes only. It does not provide financial, investment, tax or legal advice, and it is not affiliated with any government body, bank or financial institution.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>13. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when the App or the law changes. We will post the updated version on this page and change the effective date above. Please review this page from time to time.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>14. Contact us</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions, requests or complaints about this Privacy Policy, please contact:</p>
                    <p><strong>Logicpath Systems</strong><br/>
                    Email: <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);"><strong>contact@logicpathsystems.com</strong></a></p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .table-wrapper {
        overflow-x: auto;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-content th,
    .legal-content td {
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        text-align: left;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .legal-content th {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
</style>

